Original physical [[Reflections]] foil face of [[Tyrant (Reflections Foil)]], Dark Side. Photograph from Robert John. Original JPEG retained unchanged.<ref name="source">[https://www.psacard.com/psasetregistry/tcg/other-tcg-sets/2000-decipher-star-wars-ccg-reflections-foil/imagegallery/755431 Source collection entry] · [https://d1htnxwo4o0jhw.cloudfront.net/cert/155139302/liasl7JETUqcFQWiDiayww.jpg Original photograph]. Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20261114024808/https://swccg.com/snapshots/psa/reflections381-batch7-originals.html Internet Archive source photographs], including this unchanged JPEG.</ref>

